  "title": "Map of graded algebras",
  "description": "Restriction is a ring map, so generator images determine it. Transfer is only a map of modules by Frobenius reciprocity, so generator images do NOT determine it and degreewise data with a bound is required. Induction and transfer name the same map in group cohomology; the registry admits transfer only.",
